# Git
.git
.gitignore
.gitattributes

# IDE
.idea
.vscode
*.swp
*.swo

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Node
node_modules
**/node_modules

# Build outputs
dist
**/dist
build

# Env files: never ship secrets into the build context.
# 运行期配置一律走 compose 的 environment / env_file（不经 build context），
# 故此处不再对任何 .env* 开取反白名单。
**/.env
**/.env.*

# Docs (not needed at build time)
docs
*.md
!README.md

# Tests
**/*.test.ts
**/*.spec.ts
**/__tests__

# Misc
*.log
.turbo
coverage
